  "description": "Rails of Dead is a thrilling zombie survival shooter set aboard a moving train filled with danger, mystery, and the undead. Fight, explore, and survive in this action-packed horror experience!\n\nSURVIVE USING GUNS, STRATEGY & SKILL\nCollect and upgrade a wide range of weapons\nUse medkits, traps, and power-ups to stay alive\n\nDISCOVER THE MYSTERY\nPiece together the story by exploring notes, finding clues, and surviving long enough to uncover the truth.\n\nFEATURES:\nFast-paced zombie shooting gameplay\nAtmospheric horror setting on a haunted train\nSmooth controls and controller support\nPerfect for fans of action, horror, and survival games",
